yunohost (12.1.41.38) stable; urgency=low

  * nostrhost: portal logout route (fixes 404 on Sign out).
    - The portal-api now serves GET /nostrhost/portalapi/logout, which
      invalidates the portal session (deletes the session file + the
      nostrhost.portal cookie) so the SSO Sign out and the admin console's
      Sign out both actually sign the user out.

